# Personal AI Life-Log Assistant

A full-stack Django web application that lets users log daily activities, expenses, and tasks through text or voice input. The app auto-categorizes entries, supports Tamil-English bilingual input, and replies with a spoken voice summary.

## Features

- **User Authentication** – Signup, login, logout using Django's built-in auth system
- **Smart Categorization** – Keyword-based scoring logic auto-tags entries into Food, Expense, Task, Event, or General
- **Bilingual Support (Tamil + English)** – Detects Tamil text and translates it to English using Google Translate API
- **Voice Reply** – Converts daily summaries into speech using gTTS (Google Text-to-Speech)
- **Voice Input** – Users can speak entries using the browser's Web Speech API
- **Natural Language Search** – Query past entries, e.g. "what did I eat today" or "total expense this week"
- **Auto Daily Summary** – Generates a one-line summary of the day's logged entries
- **Email Reminders** – Background scheduler sends daily reminder emails at a user-set time

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| Backend | Python, Django |
| Frontend | HTML, CSS, JavaScript |
| Database | SQLite |
| Voice Output | gTTS |
| Voice Input | Web Speech API |
| Translation | deep_translator (Google Translate API) |
| Scheduling | Python `schedule` + `threading` |

